    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8ab034c859114f51a381bd41ffc26c35",
      "statement": "Chart data is not cached and is not triggered by pipeline completion: the charts core has no Redis usage, so dashboards reflect warehouse state at view time. The `has_schema_access` check is a stub that always returns True, so access is gated by org membership and the can_view_charts permission.",
      "evidence": [
