    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e12e750b8ce544b0b7fc62baf722dcff",
      "statement": "Canvas models are files in the backend's working tree, while Prefect workers git-pull or clone the remote repo at run time, so a canvas model reaches scheduled Prefect runs only after it is published through git. The canvas run-workflow path runs dbt in Celery against the local tree.",
