    {
      "id": "claim_f41d053012ce4593b77e663680110675",
      "statement": "The Ingest page's state is derived from the warehouse and sources queries, and only a successful response with no warehouse yields the no-warehouse state. A failed fetch is a separate error state, so transient Airbyte errors do not send an org with a warehouse back to warehouse setup.",
